                                "sense_id": "d3d7ebce-e5a0-38fe-b996-ab8ed29af4b9",
                                "text": "Addicted to the sentimental novels that he is fed on the sly by the son of the circulating librarianess, Edward Denham represents an outdated, Lovelacean libertinism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ba0d030-94ca-48c7-89ba-3abb5801f154",
                                "sense_id": "d3d7ebce-e5a0-38fe-b996-ab8ed29af4b9",
                                "text": "With a sardonic smile, I stared directly into the face of the librarianess."
